      <dc:description>The Prague National Theatre and the Nová Scéna stand on either side of a large plaza in Prague. A person rides a bicycle across the paved ground while another person walks near the modern, gridded building. The older, ornate stone facade of the Prague National Theatre provides a strong architectural contrast.</dc:description>
