      <film:notes>Trips from my motorcycle trip to Prague, taking photos of brutalist architecture.</film:notes>
      <film:category>street</film:category>
      <film:visionRaw>A broad plaza features contrasting architectural styles: a heavy stone building on the left next to a modern, gridded structure. In the foreground, a person rides a bicycle across the paved ground while another person walks nearby. Several windows are visible in the older facade, and some street lamps stand between the buildings.</film:visionRaw>
